// Stable quick sort family, query owned by stable_quick_sort_lib. Every stable
// partition but the sliding one, so the rotation, encoded and masked partitions,
// by every rotation. The sliding partition gathers the matches in one block
// riding behind the scan, `O(n + m r)` moves for `m` matches in `r` runs, which
// on a split of random keys is about `n^2 / 16`: a minute at 2^18 elements, so it
// is measured by the record and not catalogued.

StableQuickSorts: SortingAlgorithm = SortingAlgorithm<StableQuickSort<
    part = _ - { SlidingPartition },
    rot = _
>>
